# Read `AGENTS.md`

The rulebook for this repo is [`AGENTS.md`](../../AGENTS.md) at the root. It is the **only** always-on
file, and it is shared by Claude Code, Cursor and Codex.

Every other rule is read on demand from [`docs/rules/`](../../docs/rules/), using the index in §7 of
`AGENTS.md`. There are no `.cursor`-specific copies any more — a rule is written once.

**Cursor specifics:** skills live in `.cursor/skills/` (the same files as `.claude/skills/`); branch
prefix is `cursor/<name>-<id>`.
